Package: folletto-shell
Version: @VERSION@
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: FollettoShell maintainers <folletto@localhost>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: gnome-session, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, libglib2.0-bin, glib-networking
Recommends: gdm3, gnome-control-center, gnome-settings-daemon
Suggests: gnome-shell, mutter
Description: GNOME Shell Folletto with native i3-style tiling
 Folletto is a Mutter + GNOME Shell build with an i3-like tiling window
 manager that can be toggled alongside normal GNOME behaviour.
 .
 This package installs the runtime under /opt/folletto (it does not replace
 Debian/Ubuntu mutter or gnome-shell packages) and registers login sessions:
  - Folletto (Wayland)
  - Folletto on Xorg (X11)
 .
 Includes the Folletto settings panel and default keybindings.
